          "text": "裝修太老土",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Keith Yeung",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106564870022362823891/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI4IJaObs7nta0jgYsrcfi23jxRfseVRdmTPE936z1EvgxjVQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4"
        },
        "publishTime": "2020-05-19T03:35:41.652916Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURjeU1tYW5BRRAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURjeU1tYW5BRRAB!2m1!1s0x340401a8af75552b:0x6cdfeb98cac8032c"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJK1V1r6gBBDQRLAPIypjr32w/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SMmRXbHRkbmxKZHpkUlpqZ3hTMmQ0WVc1Wk5sRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "7 個月前",
        "rating": 3,
        "text": {
          "text": "我最近在這家餐廳參加了一個訂婚派對。員工熱情友好，盡力讓活動圓滿成功——這絕對是亮點。\n\n可惜的是，食物本身只能算一般，沒有特別令人印象深刻或出彩的地方。更令人擔憂的是用餐期間的服務：儘管活動是事先安排好的，賓客人數也已確定，但餐廳卻難以及時續餐。好幾桌客人（包括我們這桌）都等了很久才輪到下一輪上菜，這讓主人非常尷尬，也讓大家覺得以這樣的規模來說，服務完全不夠。\n\n總的來說，雖然員工熱情周到，但食物的品質，尤其是分量和續餐速度的不足，遠低於預期，與這種預先安排好的慶祝活動相去甚遠。\n\n也許以後會再來這裡吃便餐，但不會再來這裡舉辦重要的團體活動了。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "I attended an engagement party at this restaurant recently. The staff were friendly, accommodating, and did their best to make the event pleasant — that was definitely a highlight.\n\nUnfortunately, the food itself was only average — nothing particularly memorable or standout. More concerning was the service during the meal: despite the event being pre-planned with a known number of guests, the restaurant struggled to keep up with food refills in a timely manner. Several tables (including ours) were left waiting far too long between rounds, which became quite embarrassing for the hosts and made the experience feel under-served for the size of the gathering.\n\nOverall, while the staff were warm and helpful, the food quality and especially the inadequate portion timing/refill management fell short of expectations for a pre-arranged celebration of this kind.\n\nWould return for casual dining perhaps, but not for another important group event.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Joti Mann Cakes",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110688180447929936724/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWiI1ZTXkuUSOi49T1VpbFFgZuVm09cQbN2SWa5_8CpOFj0yFI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6"
