      {
        "name": "places/ChIJK1V1r6gBBDQRLAPIypjr32w/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR4c2F2eVV3EAE",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 年前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "全部素食選擇☺️\n\n- 恰普塔（Chaapte）、炒麵（Chow Mein）、餉饃（Momo）、薩莫薩三角餃（Samosa-Chaat）\n\n- 奶油扁豆湯（Dal Makhni）+ 坦杜里烤餅（Tandoori Roti）\n\n- 古拉布·賈蒙（Gulab Jamun）\n\n飲品：\n\n蘋果酒\n\n無酒精莫吉托（非常美味）\n\n服務非常好 ;)\n\n員工也很友善 :)\n\n強烈推薦",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Went for all vegetarian options ☺️\n- Chaapte, Chow Mein, Momo, Samosa-Chaat\n- Dal Makhni + Tandoori Roti\n- Gulab Jamun\n\nDrinks:\nApple cider\nVirgin Mojito (Very delicious)\n\nVery good service ;)\nThe staff are very nice as well :)\n\nHighly recommended",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Sun Tanic",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117505698432011503585/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWvHtQoWap-gNCkw4FPkhwgcROI2ZCB0025Y4Viq4WoZwGgh0E=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2"
        },
        "publishTime": "2023-06-10T13:54:38.447194Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR4c2F2eVV3EAE&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR4c2F2eVV3EAE!2m1!1s0x340401a8af75552b:0x6cdfeb98cac8032c"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJK1V1r6gBBDQRLAPIypjr32w/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURweTRhb0dnEAE",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 年前",
        "rating": 3,
        "text": {
          "text": "餐廳點評\n\n藍海餐廳酒吧；自助餐的好去處。\n\n週末我和朋友去那裡吃了自助餐。\n\n他們的員工很熱情。\n\n自助餐從下午1點到2點45分。\n\n我們下午2點到的，他們又加了一些熱菜。\n\n食物非常美味，我很喜歡。\n\n我吃了脆薯條配米飯和雞肉、印度薄餅和沙拉。\n\n不過我不喜歡魚肉太軟了。蔬菜我也很喜歡。\n\n炸雞很甜，但對我來說太辣了。\n\n我喝了可樂。\n\n帳單是按人頭算的，而不是按盤算的，這和我們之前以為的不一樣。\n\n他們的服務和食物都很好。我會把這家餐廳推薦給我的朋友。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Restaurant review\nBlue ocean restaurant and bar; a good option for Buffet.\nOver the weekend my friends and I went there for a buffet.\nTheir staff are welcoming\nThe buffet starts at 1pm to 2:45pm.\nWe arrived at 2pm and they added more hot food.\nThe food was very delicious. I loved it.\nThe food i ate  was crispy chips with rice and chicken, chapati and salads\nBut  I didn't like that the fish was too soft. I also enjoyed their vegetables.\nThe fried chicken was sweet but very spicy for me.\nTo drink I had a coca cola.\nBills were paid per head, not per plate, as we had assumed.\nTheir service and food was good. I would recommend this place to my friends.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "nankya Penry",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117135687232832897024/reviews",
